{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9f370219df043855dc909c4496e7443005a5d6c85f2e1b1f75522038b1e6e685",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a09b9d4c76bc4c98326174f81057827b8d973e5969aa7dc583a8ef6a51892b9",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。\n……喂，你是不是该有什么话对我说啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ead31334db832f37d17b6d1966d2d340fa22c0e39374df5968969775d0270f8b",
      "text": "生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:454b1ab2ecff1a5c45908ac3fb8fda1c1837907fd34c90fb8fe03aaf783ea684",
      "text": "谢啦……不对，我想听的不是这个！\n你这家伙也悄悄掺和进惊喜计划里了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73874635e4392e0c763efe2e1dd28de984baaa61508f5abf7292cc8b0de15560",
      "text": "亏我还那么认真地烦恼了半天，\n你居然全都知道，真是个坏心眼的家伙……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac209f9b183070a341d040ec2fe56b0d2808fb67f71ee52c3d231962e86e0d1f",
      "text": "嘛，不过我知道制作人也和翔太他们一样，\n都是为了让我开心才这么做的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c23de38823548a116edd89954349c7bbbb833fe6919e52eb879699f77a69af72",
      "text": "他们两个做的咖喱，你也尝过了吗？\n味道超级棒的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6384123c501f934308c2bc106a6c60201f5fd11168a6a5364a290b586026c9f4",
      "text": "嗯！\n非常好吃",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99e0b04cb15b96bb15cc36a22a3e3cbcb3bee75d5f8c730911927ab652346b0f",
      "text": "嘿嘿，对吧！\n听说经过了好多次改良……真的很厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38cf4ffa0634a241bf00ea842042e676fa3bf06035aa709c0622dc34a8dd7d3c",
      "text": "看着他们两个像咖喱一样不断进化，\n让我再次下定决心，绝不能输给他们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8426bf69943e8757e933218b9428415e321150e6779d389e1a61364bf276d9f",
      "text": "像咖喱一样……\n吗",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2778f285f75a7f7d58abf56a60dd958cb06d5b3614d032d239076ea0e8feaa0c",
      "text": "怎、干嘛啊。我明明说了很热血的话吧！\n我对咖喱可是极其认真的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fea4a6e9670a86d7437438570cdfb4a6724152bea0b969e607279dcd00532bc",
      "text": "总之……制作人送的蛋糕也很谢谢你啦。\n我们三个人一起分着吃了，超美味的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:035f070f3ea4993177e5054ed369cd1e504e1fd8ba7938be936e2217bf3e02a9",
      "text": "今后我绝对不会让你吃亏的。\n我们Jupiter还会继续进化下去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_22_t01:1_2_001_22_t01:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e0a2c49ab27f4587ca8803a12ac07521c0d01dab75bad4239ddf1bb819439c",
      "text": "所以，今后也拜托你了。\n大家一起拿下顶点吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
